	(text "Inductor ✓ \nswitches ✓ \nHigh side  ✓ \nLow side  ✓ \nCapacitor ✓\nDriver (if required:why logic mosfet cant be used)~\ninput capacitor ✓\nThe control loop(LC-for 1kHz step-expect to tune the compensator.)\nBootstrap Circuit ✓\nCurrent sensing\n\n"
