	(text "if i choose 200uH\nL1=((5)*(1-0.4166))/(37-3kHz)(0.40*2A)\n=>200uH=(5*0.5834)/34kHz * (delta(IL1)\ndelta(IL1)=0.4289A\n21.3% of I out\n\n\n"
